*
* This is a simplification of a program supplied by Lin Lyons
* to reproduce the issue reported as #943 on github.
*      The original failure was error 188:
*      PARM EQU QDAYDATE+145,100
*
IS943    CSECT
PARM     EQU   QDAYDATE+2,2
STOR     DC    XL(STORLEN)'00'
*
QDAYDATE DS    0H
         DC    4X'00'
*
STORLEN  EQU   4   No error if move this line above the STOR DC line
*
         END
